# Feedback inbox

When Spencer corrects you, rejects a change, or a rule failed to stop a
mistake, append one line to `~/.local/share/dotfiles-worker/inbox.md` before
continuing:

`- 2026-10-20 | rw-bess | personal-unit-tests | added two tests nobody asked for`

Date, repo, the rule or skill that should have caught it (or `new`), what
happened. Never edit rules from a working session. The worker does that.
